-     second in which there is an incoming defect at the layer in
-     question or at any lower layer.</t>
-          <t indent="0" pn="section-2.4.3-27">iii) Update the current interval statistics using the signal state
-     from the _previous_ update cycle and the one-second CV counts
-     and ES/SES flags shifted out of the 10-element delay line.</t>
-          <t indent="0" pn="section-2.4.3-28">This approach is further described in Appendix B.</t>
